---
---

<section id="about" class="bg-graphite text-paper py-28 md:py-40 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-35"
    style="background:
      radial-gradient(50% 50% at 90% 100%, rgba(168,133,74,0.45) 0%, rgba(47,42,38,0) 60%),
      radial-gradient(40% 40% at 0% 0%, rgba(230,205,184,0.18) 0%, rgba(47,42,38,0) 60%);"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 md:gap-20">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="w-10 h-px bg-gold-soft"></span>
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">The studio</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display display-tight text-5xl md:text-7xl text-paper">
        Made in
        <br />
        <span class="italic-gold">Ballarat,</span>
        <br />
        for businesses
        <br />
        with a postcode.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-paper/75 text-xl leading-[1.55]">
      <p>
        A local business shouldn't need a Melbourne agency to have a good website,
        a tidy Instagram, or a catalogue worth handing to a customer.
      </p>
      <p>
        We work with cafés, boutiques, makers, tradies and wineries in and around
        Ballarat. We meet in person. We answer the phone. We charge fixed prices,
        so you know what something costs before it happens.
      </p>
      <div class="hairline my-10 opacity-50"></div>
      <p class="text-paper/55 text-base leading-relaxed">
        Newly opened — and honest about it. Which is to say: hungry for the work,
        attentive to scope, and allergic to padding invoices.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
